  meta={[
    ['Role', 'Led the design sprint; UX and research for the application on my own, all wireframes'],
    ['Team', 'Mainly with Prof. Doris Bohnet, who leads the lab, Sonja Meyer and a computer scientist; interview partners from outside'],
    ['Client', 'IoT Sustainability Lab, HTWG Konstanz (Interreg project)'],
    ['Period', 'Mar – Jun 2024'],
    ['Status', 'My part: concept and wireframes. The lab presented its simulation software in September 2026'],
